#: android/assets/story/singleplayer/chapter00/part01/cinIntro.json
msgid ""
"In the chaos of war, the world was split asunder and the ancient "
"civilization of the master builders came to an end."
msgstr ""
"Im Chaos des Krieges zerbrach die Welt und die alte Zivilisation der "
"Baumeister ging unter."

#: android/assets/story/singleplayer/chapter00/part01/cinIntro.json
msgid "Today, long after the catastrophe, the old world is but a legend."
msgstr ""

#: android/assets/story/singleplayer/chapter00/part01/cinIntro.json
msgid "Those few who survived settled on the drifting ruins of the planet..."
msgstr ""

#: android/assets/story/singleplayer/chapter00/part01/cinIntro.json
msgid "...that wander slowly through the endless sea of clouds."
msgstr ""

#: android/assets/story/singleplayer/chapter00/part01/cinIntro.json
msgid "They are nomads, restless adventurers seeking their fate..."
msgstr ""

#: android/assets/story/singleplayer/chapter00/part01/cinIntro.json
msgid "They came from the Grey Market.Three friends, nomads, adventurers."
msgstr ""

#: android/assets/story/singleplayer/chapter00/part01/cinIntro.json
msgid ""
"Susie, Goliath and John - They were far and away the best when it came to "
"difficult missions."
msgstr ""

#: android/assets/story/singleplayer/chapter00/part01/cinIntro.json
msgid "The old cutthroat Trevayne had told them .."
msgstr ""

#: android/assets/story/singleplayer/chapter00/part01/cinIntro.json
msgid "...Of a mysterious island in the territory of the Sentinels"
msgstr ""

#: android/assets/story/singleplayer/chapter00/part01/cinIntro.json
msgid ""
"Heavily guarded and extremely dangerous.However, rich rewards beckoned..."
msgstr ""

#: android/assets/story/singleplayer/chapter00/part01/cinIntro.json
msgid "..a cache of master builders' artifacts!"
msgstr ""

#: android/assets/story/singleplayer/chapter00/part01/cinIntro.json
msgid ""
"With this the three adventurers would be comfortable for the rest of their "
"days."
msgstr ""

#: android/assets/story/singleplayer/chapter00/part01/cinIntro.json
msgid "..although Trevayne would of course take his usual cut of the haul."
msgstr ""

#: android/assets/story/singleplayer/chapter00/part01/cinIntro.json
msgid ""
"All went according to plan, until suddenly a wing of fighters emerged from "
"the clouds ..."
msgstr ""

#: android/assets/story/singleplayer/chapter00/part01/cinIntro.json
msgid ""
"They didn't stand a chance. Two of the friends were captured immediately by "
"the Sentinels."
msgstr ""

#: android/assets/story/singleplayer/chapter00/part01/cinIntro.json
msgid "One was left for dead when his aircraft, followed by the fighter wing"
msgstr ""

#: android/assets/story/singleplayer/chapter00/part01/cinIntro.json
msgid "crashed into the rocks of a lonely island..."
msgstr ""
